{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777150/extras/sgrsteam03.gif?t=1749714781\" />New Character: Shin Getter Robo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate Getter-series robot developed by Dr. Saotome to protect [Shin Dragon]. Its devastating power is not to be underestimated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777150/extras/\u76d6\u5854\u8230\u961f.gif?t=1749714781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Stage: Getter Fleet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dimension-hopping armada is encountered after Shin Getter Robo and Shin Getter Dragon unleash the [Shin Spark]. Join them as they sail toward a shared destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Kept me waiting, Getter Team!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-Player Updates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Shin Getter Robo stages added to [Arcade Mode] and [Pilot Academy].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Shin Getter Robo Profile content (Some of them are locked to certain requirements).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Shin Getter Robo will be available throughout Single Player and Multi-Player after DLC purchase.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777150?t=1749714781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777150?t=1749714781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777150/995db5e771439e94997e026de34fe3b34ade5fdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749714781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777150/995db5e771439e94997e026de34fe3b34ade5fdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749714781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"P